    <string name="tips_body">• Android 13+ blocks Accessibility for sideloaded apps: open App info → ⋮ → Allow restricted settings, then enable the overlay.\n• Settings → Battery → Background usage limits → add Dynamic Island to “Never sleeping apps”.\n• Without the ADB permission you can still turn pop-ups off per app: Settings → Notifications → App notifications → choose an app → Pop-up off.\n• Gestures: tap to expand, long-press to open the app, swipe up to collapse, swipe sideways or tap the bubble to switch activities.</string>

